    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Machine Particle you awaken in a world devastated by a relentless war between humanity and machines. Both sides are broken, clinging to the fragments of a shattered existence. The battle has reached a stalemate\u2014but you are the key to ending it.\u00a0Discover the truth about the world as well as the secrets of your own existence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discover a Broken World</strong>: Uncover the secrets of a devastated land, from desolate wastelands to fortified enclaves.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Engage in Combat</strong>: Face enemies in intense battles, using strategy and skill to survive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade and Customize</strong>: Find new weapons, armor, and components to enhance your abilities and adapt to any challenge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Forge Connections</strong>: Interact with NPCs through meaningful conversations that reveal hidden stories and motivations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Complete Quests</strong>: Take on missions that drive the narrative and challenge your skills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Make Tough Decisions</strong>: Shape the world around you with choices that have lasting consequences.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Machine Particle you awaken in a world devastated by a relentless war between humanity and machines. Both sides are broken, clinging to the fragments of a shattered existence. The battle has reached a stalemate\u2014but you are the key to ending it.\u00a0Discover the truth about the world as well as the secrets of your own existence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discover a Broken World</strong>: Uncover the secrets of a devastated land, from desolate wastelands to fortified enclaves.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Engage in Combat</strong>: Face enemies in intense battles, using strategy and skill to survive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade and Customize</strong>: Find new weapons, armor, and components to enhance your abilities and adapt to any challenge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Forge Connections</strong>: Interact with NPCs through meaningful conversations that reveal hidden stories and motivations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Complete Quests</strong>: Take on missions that drive the narrative and challenge your skills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Make Tough Decisions</strong>: Shape the world around you with choices that have lasting consequences.</p></li></ul>",
